    {
      "section": "7.5",
      "label": "(1)",
      "text": "Because the drugs used for analgesia are often narcotic, requiring Drug Enforcement Agency (DEA) tracking if used in the United States, the drug reservoir and means to change prescriptions during infusion must be inhibited with a locked, tamper-resistant door149.",
